lization code is fragile, they are labour-intensive to create, and they are prone to breaking in the future. This project is about improve the themes in those respects. There is an engineering plan here and a breakdown here.","ts":"1637552689.044200","attachments":[{"fallback":"1738322 - [meta] Improve long-term support for colorway themes","id":1,"title":"1738322 - [meta] Improve long-term support for colorway themes","title_link":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738322","text":"NEW (nobody) in Firefox - Theme. Last updated 2021-11-13.","fields":[{"title":"Type","value":"task","short":true},{"title":"Priority","value":"P2","short":true}],"blocks":null,"service_name":"bugzilla.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/extensions/BMO/web/images/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738322","original_url":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738322"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7de243e4-9903-4b53-9bc7-61e8ee4a4336","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"詳細わからないのでかなり憶測交じりだけど \u003chttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738073\u003e\nここを起点に読んでみると、どうも今のColorwaysはとりあえずで作ったもので長期サポートを想定していないってことらしい。最初は96で消すつもりだったけど、少なくとも97～98に移動する必要があると考えている人がいるっぽい。","ts":"1637552674.043800","attachments":[{"fallback":"1738073 - Remove Colorways onboarding when MR2 Colorways expire","id":1,"title":"1738073 - Remove Colorways onboarding when MR2 Colorways expire","title_link":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738073","text":"NEW (nobody) in Firefox - Messaging System. Last updated 2021-11-13.","fields":[{"title":"Type","value":"enhancement","short":true},{"title":"Priority","value":"P2","short":true}],"blocks":null,"service_name":"bugzilla.mozilla.org","service_icon":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/extensions/BMO/web/images/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738073","original_url":"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1738073"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T4mb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cfde8aa-46d2-4432-99f6-c1f586e968f4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Bugzillaのentryで `Status:\tUNCONFIRMED` が一覧では `UNCO` にみえてずるい :shit:","ts":"1637551894.042000","thread_ts":"1637551894.042000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06ECBRTJ","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UtgB2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6e67dd6-3006-4e41-9b61-a7a4c8bbf4bb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あーbugzillaか。そりゃそうだw","ts":"1637551780.041200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+ExO6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6aa19bde-028e-4cc7-93cf-c6e33ea66c4c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"firefoxのissueとかに、どうして期間限定にしたのか、その理由がわかる資料あったりしないの?","ts":"1637551704.040900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qHV=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7cc1f6b8-de01-454b-a913-bef71ad59a49","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ユーザーが作れるならいいけどそうでないなら産廃だな","ts":"1637546740.040100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8PKAh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cf827aa-329f-4f23-a512-76b729a9523f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"メンテするのが面倒なのでは？","ts":"1637546726.039600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tired_face","count":1,"users":["U0238G3KV8D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Yx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53e5f30c-da1f-4c19-9767-9d0bd0d1317f","type":"message","user":"U7FL0Q71D","text":"Colorways、なぜか期間限定なのでどういうことなんだろうかという気持ち…設定したテーマはその後も使えるようですが。\n\u003chttps://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211103-2176263/\u003e\n\nあと、Firefox Color \u003chttps://color.firefox.com/\u003e というのも前からありますがそれとの関連性も謎…","ts":"1637544353.039200","attachments":[{"fallback":"マイナビニュース: 「Firefox 94」安定版リリース、期間限定カラーでカスタマイズ「Colorways」","id":1,"title":"「Firefox 94」安定版リリース、期間限定カラーでカスタマイズ「Colorways」","title_link":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211103-2176263/","text":"Webブラウザ「Firefox 94」の安定版の配信が始まった。「Colorways」というユーザーが色で表現できる新しいテーマ機能を追加。トレンドや季節を取り入れた6つのカラーテーマを期間限定で提供する。また、モバイル版のホーム画面を刷新した。","image_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211103-2176263/index_images/index.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1635896967,"service_name":"マイナビニュース","service_icon":"https://news.mynavi.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211103-2176263/","original_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211103-2176263/"},{"fallback":"Firefox Color","id":2,"title":"Firefox Color","title_link":"https://color.firefox.com/","text":"Theming experiment for Firefox Quantum and beyond.","thumb_url":"https://color.firefox.com/images/color-fb.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"color.firefox.com","service_icon":"https://color.firefox.com/favicon.ico","thumb_width":2400,"thumb_height":1260,"from_url":"https://color.firefox.com/","original_url":"https://color.firefox.com/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tuc0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3B342772-7F53-43C6-B908-1FDE0F681319","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ほほー","ts":"1637509632.037600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EywR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c87cc9f-b334-409f-b0d5-3e5a8b94db43","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"FirefoxにColorwaysなる機能が来た。なんとなく黄色くしてみたけど、黒地に白文字より読み易くて良い気がする。","ts":"1637509030.037100","files":[{"id":"F02MPNXBHAT","created":1637508992,"timestamp":1637508992,"name":"image.png","title":"image.png","mimetype":"image/png","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"png","p